  "findings": [
    "The official GenBio model index contains no AIDO.DNA2 entry; exact-name search returns an empty list. This does not prove the absence of unpublished or unindexed artifacts.",
    "Cerberus release README explicitly says processed training data are pending; the abstract claim of released data is not a processed cohort manifest.",
    "NABench pinned tree contains extraction scripts but no downstream ridge runner or complete model-by-assay execution manifest.",
    "Genos-m, DeepD and NABench main revisions match the previously inspected releases.",
    "DeepD DC2, Cerberus/LOAM XML and AlphaGenome2 supplements remain inaccessible at the identified publisher endpoints (HTTP429); Carbon dataset APIs return401.",
    "BaseSpace public share redirects to Illumina login in a browser; no authenticated access attempted.",
    "Synapse task5 entity metadata is public, but both version2 file-handle endpoints returned403 for anonymous access.",
    "All five DOI-specific DNALongBench Dataverse metadata API requests returned403."
  ],
